SUMMARY:Dom Francis
LOCATION:Blue Moon Saloon and Guest House\, 215 East Convent Street\, Lafay
 ette
DESCRIPTION:Some bands chase nostalgia. Dom Francis chases the feeling that
  made rock & roll matter in the first place.\n\nBased in Austin\, Texas\, 
 the band writes guitar-driven songs that blur the lines between rock\, cou
 ntry\, blues\, soul\, and Americana without ever sounding like a throwback
  act. Their music carries the grit of late-night bars\, open highways\, an
 d dance halls—equal parts swagger and sincerity.\n\nOnstage\, Dom Franci
 s favors momentum over spectacle. Their shows are loud\, loose\, and built
  to keep people moving\, whether they're playing a neighborhood honky-tonk
  or a packed club. It's a live band in the truest sense: no gimmicks\, no 
 backing tracks\, just musicians feeding off the room and each other.\n\nAs
  their audience continues to grow across Texas\, Dom Francis is proving th
 ere's still a place for honest rock & roll—music that feels lived-in\, t
 imeless\, and impossible to fake. After releasing his debut album “The W
 anderer” in 2025\, Francis presents us with his sophomore rock-leaning 
 “The State of Things”\n\nhttps://events.timely.fun/kw4jncf1/event/7850
 7327/20261204200000
